<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JAN TRADE GAP $210 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JAN TRADE GAP $210 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's trade deficit was</p>
<p>$210 million in January, down from $417 in December 1996 and</p>
<p>$302 in January 1996, the National Bank of Hungary said on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY TRADE DEFICIT (in million dollars)</p>
<p>			   Jan 97    Dec 96    Jan-Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    Exports	    1,459     1,395	 14,183	1,056</p>
<p>    Imports   	1,669     1,812	 16,828	1,358</p>
<p>    Trade balance     -210	-417	 -2,645	 -302</p>
<p>NOTE - The central bank's figures are based on cash flow,</p>
<p>while Ministry of Industry, Trade and Tourism data are based on</p>
<p>customs statistics.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
